  "prompt": "\nCreate a single-page website with the following requirements:\n\nThe website should be designed based on the specific content and theme described in the user command below. The user command is a natural language description that outlines the desired content, purpose, or theme of the website (e.g., a restaurant reservation site, a portfolio, etc.). Incorporate the user command's instructions holistically into the design, content, and functionality while adhering to the requirements below.\n\n- **Design and Layout**: \n  - Design a visually appealing, modern, and clean layout with a professional and aesthetic UI.\n  - Use a mainstream UI framework (e.g., Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap, or similar) for styling to ensure a polished and contemporary look.\n  - Ensure the design is highly readable with clear typography and sufficient contrast.\n\n- **Code Structure**:\n  - All code (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) must be integrated into a single HTML file.\n  - Use modern JavaScript syntax and, if needed, include CDN-hosted dependencies for frameworks (e.g., Tailwind CSS via CDN).\n  - Do not use external files or resources beyond CDN-hosted libraries.\n\n- **Content and Functionality**:\n  - The website must be a single page with all content visible without scrolling (fits within the viewport).\n  - Include a simple, elegant structure (e.g., header, main content, footer) tailored to the user command's description.\n  - Optionally, add lightweight interactivity (e.g., hover effects, button click actions) to enhance modern feel without complexity.\n\n- **User Command**:\n  - The topic of the website is Data visualization.\n  - Design a site showcasing art movements through interactive timelines and immersive galleries. Users can navigate eras, view pivotal works, and engage with artist biographies. Key features include virtual exhibitions, cross-era comparisons, and community discussions, connecting enthusiasts and scholars with historical and contemporary art evolution.\n